<title>POLAND: KREDYT BANK MAY NET RISES TO PLN 3.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>KREDYT BANK MAY NET RISES TO PLN 3.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY						  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.46 vs    1.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    3.53 vs    2.20</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 13.82 vs   12.83</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	30.81 vs   19.42</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY					 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 23.64 vs    8.86</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   37.73 vs   14.77</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		108.90 vs   54.79</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     146.61 vs   91.36</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Kredyt Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
